OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be dry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells. This afternoon will
OL,7,Fremain mainly dry but becoming rather
OL,8,Fcloudy. Chance of a shower across
OL,9,Fwestern Tayside later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with rain
OL,12,Fspreading from the west. Drier and
OL,13,Fclearer weather will develop during
OL,14,Fthe early hours. Fresh west or
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds at times.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,18,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,19,Fand most frequent across the west.
OL,20,FFresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
