OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAfter a
OL,6,Fdry start on Friday outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fwill spread east for a time in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Windy with bright spells
OL,9,Fand a few showers on Saturday. Dry
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
